          "text": "Description: On November 11, 12, and 20, 1977, between 5:30 PM and 6:45 PM, a witness observed an unusual object in the sky that intrigued them. The object, either stationary or in motion, had a triangular shape and varied colors. No other testimonies were collected. The gendarmerie made no observations of this phenomenon, for which we lack information.",
